  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices\n• In a frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62906eabdf17b5c02a0b1f42/step-a665d493.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Prick holes in couscous packet. Microwave until steaming, 1 min\n• Halve cherry tomatoes\n• Roughly chop almonds",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62906eabdf17b5c02a0b1f42/step-7df0e15b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a bowl, toss couscous, kalamata olives, baby spinach and a drizzle of oil. Season\n• Plate up couscous. Top with tomatoes, haloumi and almonds\n• Drizzle with balsamic glaze. Tear over parsley to serve",
